Real coefficients for the element routines in this addon.
--------------------------------------------------------

  1-100: all relevant real parameters from the stokes & viscoelastic add-on
101-150: reserved for diffuse-interface add-on
151-200: reserved for inertia add-on
201-250: reserved for generalized Stokes add-on
251-300: reserved for compressible fluid add-on
301-350: reserved for deformation fields add-on
351-400: reserved for convection-diffusion-reaction using SUPG add-on

401  deltat: timestep in the stochastic model

402-450 reserved for future use

m   Start at index m=coefficient%i(453): the material data for the stochastic
    model in the following sequence:
         G, lambda, ( par^j, j=1, npar )
    where par^j are the npar nonlinear parameters 
    For example a FENE model:
       G, lambda, b
